### SendGrid Email Service API Tests
### Test the SendGrid email integration for verification codes and emails
### Make sure to configure SENDGRID_API_KEY and SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL in .env file

@baseUrl = https://localhost:8443/api
@testEmail = your.email@example.com
@testPassword = SecurePass123!
@testUsername = sendgrid_test_user

### Prerequisites:
### 1. Configure SendGrid API key in .env file
### 2. Set verified sender email in .env file
### 3. Server must be running with HTTPS

# ===================================================================
# EMAIL VERIFICATION FLOW TESTS
# ===================================================================

### 1. Health Check
GET https://localhost:8443/health

### 2. Start Verification Process - Email Verification Code Will Be Sent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/start-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{testUsername}}",
    "email": "{{testEmail}}",
    "password": "{{testPassword}}",
    "gender": "Male",
    "role": "Pet owner",
    "phone": "+84901234567",
    "city": "Ho Chi Minh City",
    "address": "123 Test Street, District 1"
}

### 3. Verify Email with Code (Use code from email received)
### Replace EMAIL_CODE_FROM_EMAIL with actual code from your email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-registration-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_FROM_STEP_2",
    "emailCode": "EMAIL_CODE_FROM_EMAIL"
}

### 4. Complete Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/complete-registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_FROM_STEP_2"
}

### 5. Login to Get JWT Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{testEmail}}",
    "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

# ===================================================================
# FORGOT PASSWORD EMAIL TESTS
# ===================================================================

### 6. Request Password Reset - Password Reset Email Will Be Sent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{testEmail}}"
}

### 7. Reset Password with Code (Use code from email received)
### Replace PASSWORD_RESET_CODE with actual code from your email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{testEmail}}",
    "code": "PASSWORD_RESET_CODE",
    "newPassword": "NewSecurePass123!"
}

# ===================================================================
# RESEND EMAIL TESTS
# ===================================================================

### 8. Resend Password Reset Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-password-reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{testEmail}}"
}

### 9. Resend Email Verification (for new users)
