# EXPECTED RESULTS
# ===================================================================

### Expected Email Types to Receive:
### 1. Email Verification Code - 6-digit code with professional template
### 2. Welcome Email - Sent after successful registration completion
### 3. Password Reset Code - 6-digit code for password reset
### 4. Password Reset Success - Confirmation after password change

### Email Features to Verify:
### ✅ Professional HTML templates with Pet Care Service branding
### ✅ Clear verification codes (6-digit numbers)
### ✅ Security warnings about code expiration (1 minute)
### ✅ Sender email matches SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL
### ✅ Subject lines are appropriate
### ✅ No HTML rendering issues
### ✅ SendGrid delivery tracking

### Troubleshooting:
### 1. Check spam/junk folders if emails don't arrive
### 2. Verify SendGrid API key is valid and has send permissions
### 3. Ensure sender email is verified in SendGrid dashboard
### 4. Check server logs for SendGrid API responses
### 5. Verify .env configuration is loaded correctly

### SendGrid Configuration Check:
### 1. SENDGRID_API_KEY should start with "SG."
### 2. SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL should be verified in SendGrid
### 3. Remove comments (#) from environment variables
### 4. Restart server after .env changes

### To Enable SendGrid:
### 1. Uncomment SENDGRID_API_KEY in .env
### 2. Uncomment SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL in .env
### 3. Add your actual SendGrid API key
### 4. Add your verified sender email
### 5. Restart the server
